Events</span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Our
physical events started in the fiscal year ended December 31, 2023 as a result of our corporate restructuring. For details on our corporate
restructuring, please see &#8220;Corporate History and Structure.&#8221; Our physical events include live streaming and video recording
of physical events, video editing and production, and a custom on-demand video library for finished video content to be viewed and downloaded.</span></p>

