<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Currently,
there are no federal or state tax audits pending. The Company&#8217;s corporate federal and state tax returns from 2022 to 2024 remain
subject to examination by tax authorities.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">At
December 31, 2025, the Company did <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--UnrecognizedTaxBenefits_iI_pn3n3_do_c20251231_zm8h2O3IWfMg" title="Unrecognized tax benefits"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:UnrecognizedTaxBenefits" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31" id="Fact000952" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">no</ix:nonFraction></span>t have any unrecognized tax benefits and did not anticipate any significant changes to the unrecognized
tax benefits within twelve months of this reporting date. In the year ended December 31, 2025, the Company recorded no interest and penalties
on income taxes. At December 31, 2025, there was no accrued interest included in income taxes payable.</span></p>

